OL,3,AReform donations row overshadows
OL,4,Aparty's moment to lay out big ideas
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeak to people at the highest levels
OL,7,Fof Reform UK and they will admit the
OL,8,Fparty has struggled in recent weeks.
OL,10,FReform's polling numbers have dipped,
OL,11,Fwhile Labour's have risen.
OL,13,FOne of their aims at this conference
OL,14,Fwas to demonstrate Reform is a serious
OL,15,Fparty of government. After a summer
OL,16,Ffighting the by-election in Clacton,
OL,17,Fwhich the other main parties boycotted,
OL,18,Fthe party wanted to demonstrate they
OL,19,Fhave a plan for government, focusing on
OL,20,Fimmigration and the cost of living.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
