OL,5,
OL,6,FA press conference alongside Jordan
OL,7,FBardella, President of the National
OL,8,FRally which leads the polls in France,
OL,9,Fwas part of that effort, and the
OL,10,Fintention was to project serious
OL,11,Finternational co-operation with another
OL,12,Finsurgent party on the right.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
