OL,3,ANepal rescuers try to reach dozens
OL,4,Atrapped in tunnel as two pulled out
OL,5,Aalive and one found dead
OL,6,
OL,7,FDramatic footage from earlier shows the
OL,8,Fmoment Sanjaya Shah and Kabir Maharjan
OL,9,Fare pulled alive from the Trishuli 3A
OL,10,FHydropower Project - watch the video
OL,11,Fhere
OL,13,FThe body of a third person has been
OL,14,Ffound at the site, with authorities
OL,15,Fsaying they likely "died after being
OL,16,Fcaught in floodwater while trying to
OL,17,Fflee from the tunnel"
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
